// A decision only the owner can make (tickets-patterns syntax.tex, the core kinds): opened by an agent that cannot go
// on without the owner's word, or by a pattern (the claim, when its reviewers cannot tell). Its one step is the
// owner's (`step owner`: no fills, the owner directly), answered on the Tickets page with a button per result and one
// text box. It does not expire (policy/tickets.eflint).
/// a decision only the owner can make
kind decision
  letter D
  form question: Text, context: Text?
  result Yes(note: Text?) | No(why: Text)
  pattern
    step owner decide(question, context)
